'''Brainwashed Tank Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]], [[June Bride (Gacha Event)|June Bride]] and [[Ultra 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Ultra 4 Selection]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] replaces [[Resistant]] with [[Insanely Tough]] and increases speed.

