==Trivia==
*The text on Brainwashed Eraser Cat's body is ネコケシ ''Neko Keshi'' (Cat Eraser) written in sideways katakana.
*Brainwashed Eraser Cat and [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]] are the only non-[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]]/[[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare]] units to have the [[Insanely Tough]] ability.
*Interestingly, a closer look at its outline reveals rougher, slightly jagged sorts of edges that other tank cats don't have.

